<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: ATHLETICS-GRAND PRIX SCHEDULE FOR 1997.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-GRAND PRIX SCHEDULE FOR 1997.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grand prix athletics schedule for</p>
<p>1997 released by the International Amateur Athletic Federation</p>
<p>on Thursday:</p>
<p>May 4 - Rio de Janeiro</p>
<p>May 10 - Osaka, Japan</p>
<p>May 18 - Charlotte, U.S.</p>
<p>May 25 - Eugene, U.S.</p>
<p>June 5 - Rome</p>
<p>June 8 - Moscow</p>
<p>June 25 - Paris</p>
<p>June 29 - London</p>
<p>July 2 - Lausanne, Switzerland</p>
<p>July 4 - Oslo</p>
<p>July 7 - Stockholm</p>
<p>July 16 - Nice, France</p>
<p>August 13 - Zurich</p>
<p>August 16 - Monaco</p>
<p>August 22 - Brussels</p>
<p>August 24 - Cologne, Germany</p>
<p>August 26 or September 5 - Berlin</p>
<p>September 13 - Final, Fukuoka, Japan</p>
</text>
